  "prefLabel": "Plc 2006.01 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 2006.01 Applicability.\n\n(a) The standards in this part shall apply to each individual who applies to be certified under RSA 326-N or who is voluntarily certified under RSA 326-N.\n\n(b) Violations of these standards shall constitute unprofessional conduct that subjects the violator to disciplinary proceedings pursuant to Plc 311.\n\nSource. #14217, INTERIM, eff 4-1-25; ss by #14388, eff 10-24-25, EXPIRES: 10-24-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc2000.html"
